Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 15:02:57 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat(simulator): add LinkGate gateway mode

Each simulated device opens its own TCP connection to the gateway's device
port, sends a heartbeat every second and reconnects with exponential backoff.
The existing listen mode is unchanged.
---
